# Managed macOS `defaults`, one per line. Loaded by macos.sh (and read by check.sh).
# Format (pipe-delimited): domain | key | type | desired | restart | area | label | display-value | tol
#   domain:  plain defaults domain, or @host/<domain> for `defaults -currentHost` (ByHost)
#   type:    string | int | float | bool
#   tol:     optional ± tolerance for int/float (e.g. 1 => desired ±1 all pass); blank/omitted = exact
#   restart: process to killall after a change (Dock / Finder / SystemUIServer), or "logout", or empty
#   display: uses literal Markdown backticks for `macos.sh --list`; @HOME@ -> $HOME at runtime
# Blank lines and lines beginning with # are ignored.
NSGlobalDomain|AppleInterfaceStyle|string|Dark|logout|Appearance|Theme|`Dark`
com.apple.dock|tilesize|float|39|Dock|Dock|Icon size|`39` (±1, accepts 38-40)|1
com.apple.dock|show-recents|bool|false|Dock|Dock|Show recent apps|`false` (Off)
com.apple.dock|mru-spaces|bool|false|Dock|Dock|Auto-rearrange Spaces|`false` (Off)
com.apple.finder|FXPreferredViewStyle|string|icnv|Finder|Finder|Default view|`icnv` (Icon view)
com.apple.finder|ShowHardDrivesOnDesktop|bool|false|Finder|Finder|Hard drives on Desktop|`false` (Off)
com.apple.finder|NewWindowTarget|string|PfHm|Finder|Finder|New window target|`PfHm` (Home)
com.apple.finder|_FXShowPosixPathInTitle|bool|true|Finder|Finder|Full POSIX path in title|`true` (On)
com.apple.screencapture|location|string|@HOME@/Pictures|SystemUIServer|Screenshots|Save location|`~/Pictures`
com.apple.menuextra.clock|ShowAMPM|bool|true|SystemUIServer|Control Center|Clock — Show AM/PM|`true` (On)
com.apple.menuextra.clock|ShowDayOfWeek|bool|true|SystemUIServer|Control Center|Clock — Show day of week|`true` (On)
com.apple.menuextra.clock|ShowDate|int|1|SystemUIServer|Control Center|Clock — Show date|`1` (On)
NSGlobalDomain|com.apple.sound.beep.feedback|int|1||Sound|Volume-change feedback|`1` (On)
@host/com.apple.controlcenter|Spotlight|int|8|ControlCenter|Menu Bar|Spotlight|`8` (Don't Show)
com.apple.controlcenter|NSStatusItem Visible FocusModes|bool|false|ControlCenter|Menu Bar|Focus icon|`false` (Off)
com.apple.ImageCapture|disableHotPlug|bool|true||Photos|Open Photos for devices|`true` (Off — do not auto-open)
@host/com.apple.controlcenter|NowPlaying|int|8|ControlCenter|Menu Bar|Now Playing|`8` (Don't Show)
